==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|ku}}

===Etymology===
*Agent participle of the verb ''[[kuolla]]''.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun|kuolem|type=koira}}

# [[death|Death]], [[demise]], [[decease]].
#:[[tuomita]] ''kuolemaan'' (+ ''genitive-accusative'') = to [[sentence]]/[[condemn]] (sb) ''to death''.

====Synonyms====
*(''death; euphemistic'') [[poismeno]]
*(''death; archaic'') [[tuoni]]

====Derived terms====
*[[tehdä]] ''kuolemaa'' = to [[be]] [[die|dying]]
*[[olla]] ''[[kuolemaisillaan]]'' = to [[be]] [[at death's door]]/[[dying]]/near [[death]]
*[[olla]] ''kuoleman'' [[kieli|kielissä]] = to [[be]] [[at death's door]]
*adjectives: [[kuolematon]]

